  "title": "Udemy Announces First Wave of Instructor-Led Innovations, Driving the Future of Learning Through the Udemy Content Innovation Fund",
  "summary": "Today we are excited to announce the first wave of instructor-led innovations, driving the future of learning through the Content Innovation Fund—an initiative designed to empower Udemy instructors to pioneer new, immersive, and outcomes-driven learning experiences. This first wave highlights the creativity, insights, and leadership of Udemy instructors, who are reimagining how learning happens […]",
